OL,7,     Fdad's death threatens her plans to
OL,8,     Fearn extra money. And Ruby and
OL,9,     FTrewley have ambitious plans for
OL,10,     FBonfire Night. (Ep3)
OL,11,G0005 Naked Attraction
OL,12,     FStudent Josh has never had any
OL,13,     Fluck chatting up the ladies... can
OL,14,     FNaked Attraction help? And
OL,15,     Fperformer Jack's after that
OL,16,     Fspecial someone to give him a
OL,17,     Fstanding ovation.
