OL,5,G2230 Manhunt: Search for the Cop Killer
OL,6,     FFor 18 days in 1982, 4000 police
OL,7,     Fofficers scoured North Yorkshire
OL,8,     Ffor the fugitive who had shot dead
OL,9,     Ftwo police officers and a local
OL,10,     Fpensioner: a "Phantom" named Barry
OL,11,     FPrudom.
OL,12,G0005 The Cannibal Next Door
OL,13,     FThe shocking story of Armin
OL,14,     FMeiwes, one of the world's most
OL,15,     Fnotorious cannibals, told by those
OL,16,     Fclose to the case, who discuss how
OL,17,     Fthe killer and the victim's lives
OL,18,     Fled to a fatal night together.
